# CPP audit round 2: DSPOPT's message ID with no volume (F1 on it).
# Read-only. Its second half stopped (the cursor was off the command
# line); probe-msgid-more.tn has DSPTAPCTG.
wait "Main Menu"
timeout 30000
type call qcmd
key enter
wait "Command Entry"
type DSPOPT VOL(*MOUNTED) DEV(OPT01)
key enter
settle 3000
cursor 5 7
key f1
settle 2000
snap ids-dspopt
key f12
settle 2000
